∇ r←exportArrowBytes(con sql);rows;size;dataptr;errptr;st;msg;bytes
⍝ Export aggregated query results to Arrow IPC bytes in memory.
⍝ con: duckdb connection handle
⍝ sql: SELECT with aggregation suitable for charts
⍝ r: (bytes rows) — Arrow IPC bytes and row count
 rows←0
 size←0
 dataptr←0
 errptr←0
 st←api.duckdb_export_query_arrow_ipc_buffer con sql rows dataptr size errptr
 :If st≠DuckDBSuccess
     :If errptr≠0
         msg←1024 read.utf8 errptr
         {}api.duckdb_free errptr
     :Else
         msg←'Arrow buffer export failed'
     :EndIf
     ⎕SIGNAL msg
 :EndIf
 :If (0=size)∨0=dataptr
     ⎕SIGNAL 'Arrow buffer export returned no data'
 :EndIf
 bytes←size read.u8 dataptr
 {}api.duckdb_free dataptr
 r←bytes rows
∇
